    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S1",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "S1_N",
     "voice": "N",
     "text": "One morning, a sheep was missing. There was a hole in the pen."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S2",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "S2_N",
     "voice": "N",
     "text": "His neighbor said: fix it! He shrugged: why bother?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S3",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "S3_N",
     "voice": "N",
     "text": "Next morning, another one was gone."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "S4",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "S4_N",
     "voice": "N",
     "text": "So he fixed the pen, and never lost another sheep."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "R",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "R_M",
     "voice": "M",
     "text": "亡羊补牢。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "U",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "A_N",
     "voice": "N",
     "text": "It's never too late to fix it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C",
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "C_N",
     "voice": "N",
     "text": "Did you get it right? A, B, or C?"
    }
   ]
